// AoC 2026 Day NN starter. Copy this file to dayNN.crust (e.g. day06.crust),
// save the puzzle's input as dayNN_input.txt alongside it, and fill in
// the two recipes below.
//
//   cp examples/dayNN_template.crust day06.crust
//   crust develop day06.crust           # step through it as you write it
//   crust run day06.crust --store=part1 < day06_input.txt
//   crust run day06.crust --store=part2 < day06_input.txt
//
// unbox() reads whichever input `crust run`/`crust develop` was given
// (stdin, or the Run tab's input-file field) — lines(unbox()) splits it
// into a List of lines, ints(...) turns numeric strings into Integers.
// See docs/CHEATSHEET.md for the full builtin list and a few common
// parsing idioms (grid puzzles, "key: value" lines, memoization, ...).

recipe store_part1() {
    input = lines(unbox())
    deliver(slices(input))
}

recipe store_part2() {
    input = lines(unbox())
    deliver(slices(input))
}
